// # LSP Server Lifecycle
//
// Logline: Server loop, JSON-RPC dispatch, request guards, per-method handlers, capabilities, version.
//
// Setup: Drives the request lifecycle. Depends on wire (transport), types (payloads), methods (business logic), symbols (data).
//
// Beats:
//   1. 5 files implementing the server layer.
//   2. All files follow the 4-element Academy header and the 256-line cap.
//   3. Imports go to siblings in this subdir; cross-subdir imports use the new lsp/<subdir>/<file> path.

import "lsp_version.oo";
import "lsp_server_capabilities.oo";
import "lsp_server_dispatch.oo";
import "lsp_server_guards.oo";
import "lsp_server_handlers.oo";
